invalid type: string "Incident Alert: TLS Certificate Expired\nComponent: gateway\nEnvironment: production\n\nSummary: External HTTPS requests started failing.\n\nRoot Causes:\n- Ingress TLS certificate expired.\n  Analysis: The TLS certificate was not renewed before its expiration date.\n  Evidence: Clients received certificate validation errors.\n\nRecommended Actions:\nfrom 200 ms to 2.8 s.\n\n